/-- The structure constants of compact `e₈` in the orthonormal basis of the module docstring,
grouped into blocks by slot triple. A code `t` stands for the triple `(i, j, k) = (t / 5 / 248², t / 5 / 248 % 248, t / 5 % 248)`, `i < j < k`, with
`f_{ijk} = t % 5 − 2`. Generated by `research/code/e8_structure.py`.

DERIVED: the root system of `E₈` and the cocycle of the generator; no numeral is chosen here. -/
